\* All TLC check configs for AntflyPlacementReadiness.tla.

==== positive tier=fast
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyUnknownReportLatchesAmbiguity = FALSE
    BuggyLeaderAloneAdmitsTransition = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    UnknownReportsDoNotCreateAuthoritativeConflict
    TransitionRequiresStablePlacement
    KnownAndAmbiguousAreExclusive

==== heavy-liveness tier=heavy
SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyUnknownReportLatchesAmbiguity = FALSE
    BuggyLeaderAloneAdmitsTransition = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    UnknownReportsDoNotCreateAuthoritativeConflict
    TransitionRequiresStablePlacement
    KnownAndAmbiguousAreExclusive

PROPERTIES
    EvidenceEventuallyRecoversReadiness
    TransitionEventuallyStarts

==== BadUnknownReportLatchesAmbiguity
\* Expected-failure B1 mutant: a follower that disclaims voter-set knowledge
\* reports a partial count and latches ambiguity against the exact leader count.
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyUnknownReportLatchesAmbiguity = TRUE
    BuggyLeaderAloneAdmitsTransition = FALSE

INVARIANT UnknownReportsDoNotCreateAuthoritativeConflict

==== BadLeaderAloneAdmitsTransition
\* Expected-failure mutant: a known leader bypasses the remaining stable
\* placement conjuncts.
SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyUnknownReportLatchesAmbiguity = FALSE
    BuggyLeaderAloneAdmitsTransition = TRUE

INVARIANT TransitionRequiresStablePlacement
